                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Millions of Americans are about to see their healthcare premiums double, and over 340,000 people, including 20,000 here in California, could lose their jobs if ACA healthcare tax credits expire. That\u2019s hundreds of thousands of families losing income, and millions more unable to afford coverage. Yet Congressional Republicans are pushing forward with no plan except to tank the economy and leave working Americans behind.\n\nhttps://t.co/NZDNxbAugc",
