                "text": "People in our community aren\u2019t asking for a handout \u2014 they\u2019re asking for fairness and stability in their health care. Everyone deserves access to quality, affordable healthcare, and that\u2019s what I\u2019m fighting for. https://t.co/6tlokYW9nS",
