                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Congressional Republicans are playing the blame game in this shutdown instead of working with Democrats to end it. And who are they blaming? Undocumented immigrants, who can\u2019t even get healthcare tax credits under the ACA, and are regulated by the Department of Homeland Security, which Republicans also control. Democrats are here fighting for your healthcare.",
