                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Make no mistake, nobody in America should be denied access to healthcare or be forced into bankruptcy because of their medical bills. We\u2019re the richest country in the world and we feed the rest of the world \u2013 no child should go to school or to bed hungry. And federal workers are being treated as collateral damage \u2013 that shouldn\u2019t happen. These are people\u2019s lives, not a game.",
